# Drafted by Lab Deploy: an allow-list. Nothing enters the image unless a "!" line below lets it in, so a new file (a .env,
# a key, a dataset, a notebook) is never copied into the image by accident. When the service needs another file or
# directory at runtime, add a "!name" line for it.
*
__ALLOW__
# Never in the image, even inside the directories above.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/tests
**/test_*.py
**/.DS_Store
